/build
sdk/*/build
apps/**/build
**/dist
**/data
**/review-state
**/node_modules
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.runtime
**/.qa
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-*
**/*.db
